    "<div style='text-align:Left;'><p><span>The Town of Whitby\"s Building Department assigns a municipal address to each property with a building. Address point data consists of a municipal address number and in some cases a unit number. The municipal address may contain a unit number if the building contains multiple owners or multiple tenants.</span></p><p><a target='_blank' href='https://whitby.maps.arcgis.com:443/sharing/rest/content/items/64f887c185e34335abd9a70cf24bffb3/data' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span>Click here for additional metadata</span></a></p><p><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Updated September 2026.</span></p><p><strong>This view was created to be used in the Town's Open Data portal.</strong><br />&nbsp;</p></div>"
